stop
footer
Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. Unlike chat, this wrapper rejects temperature zero and applies explicit upper
limits. It casts token.Mu into fields named logprobs; probability interpretation is not
established by this mapping. Quote/prompt effects precede generation; no combined rollback
appears here. Stream cancellation is not handled by the non-cancellation catch.
